{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T13:52:08",
      "utterance": "相談者役をさせて頂きます。どうぞよろしくお願い致します。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T13:58:21",
      "utterance": "こちらこそよろしくお願いします",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T13:58:44",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。よろしくお願い致します。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:00:35",
      "utterance": "相談員です　こんにちは　始めに　年齢と性別を教えてください",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:00:48",
      "utterance": "17歳　女性です",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:01:08",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:01:25",
      "utterance": "今日はどのような　ご相談ですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:01:54",
      "utterance": "クラスの人から嫌がらせをされています",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:02:16",
      "utterance": "嫌がらせは嫌ですよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:02:21",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:03:13",
      "utterance": "状況を詳しく聞きたいので　いくつか質問させて頂いてもよろしいですか？",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:03:19",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:03:54",
      "utterance": "学校にはちゃんと登校してますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:04:11",
      "utterance": "はい、一応。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:05:20",
      "utterance": "では学校での　嫌がらせの事を　言える範囲内でよいのでもう少し教えてくださいね",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:05:30",
      "utterance": "はい、、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:06:25",
      "utterance": "どの様な嫌がらせなんでしょう？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:07:22",
      "utterance": "体育の授業前に体育館に行ったら、バスケットボールを投げつけられて、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:07:50",
      "utterance": "それは　ひどいですね　お辛かったでしょう？",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:08:04",
      "utterance": "はい。あと、すれ違う時に舌打ちされたり、睨まれたりしています。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:09:29",
      "utterance": "色々な嫌がらせを受けてしまうのは本当につらいでしょうし　悲しいですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:09:55",
      "utterance": "最近は席替えで",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:10:01",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:10:23",
      "utterance": "その人たちと近い席になって",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:10:33",
      "utterance": "もう嫌です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:12:14",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。嫌がらせをされてる人と近い席になりどうしてよいのか　わからない様子に感じますが　どうですか？",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:12:57",
      "utterance": "担任の先生には手紙を書いたり、職員室に行って伝えました。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:13:51",
      "utterance": "それで　先生は何か対応してくれましたか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:14:12",
      "utterance": "先生は、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:14:22",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:15:05",
      "utterance": "席替えの事はみんな平等だから、あなただけ特別扱いをするわけにはいかないと言われました。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:16:14",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。　あなたの意見は　聞いてもらえなかったんですねそれは　残念です",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:17:06",
      "utterance": "せっかく　勇気をだして　先生の所まで　いったのにね…悔しいですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:17:18",
      "utterance": "誰も私の事を分かってくれないと思いました。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:18:18",
      "utterance": "どうして　わかってくれないとおもうのか　思い当たる所はありかすか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:19:05",
      "utterance": "よくわからないです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:19:17",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:20:21",
      "utterance": "お友達とは普段はお話されてますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:20:39",
      "utterance": "まあ、普通に。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:21:39",
      "utterance": "お友達の関係の事を少し教えてくれますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:22:00",
      "utterance": "部活で話したりしてます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:22:26",
      "utterance": "お話は普通にしてるんですね",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:22:34",
      "utterance": "まあ、はい。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:23:09",
      "utterance": "では　どんな時に嫌がらせを　されるのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:23:48",
      "utterance": "だから、授業の前とか、すれ違う時とか、さっき話しましたよね。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:25:56",
      "utterance": "はい　聞いてますね。部活の時は　話せるのに　部活以外で嫌がらせをされる理由でもあるんですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:26:12",
      "utterance": "それはわからないです。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:26:52",
      "utterance": "何で嫌がらせされている私が責められないといけないんですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:27:09",
      "utterance": "自分でも　わからないのは　もどかしいですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:27:30",
      "utterance": "違います。あなたに話しているんです。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:28:23",
      "utterance": "ええ　わかっています　何か勘違いをせてしまったのなら　ごめんなさいね",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:28:24",
      "utterance": "相談員さんに。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:28:42",
      "utterance": "勘違いって、、私が悪いみたい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:29:32",
      "utterance": "私の言い方がわるかったんですね　すみません",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:30:35",
      "utterance": "もういいです。大丈夫です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:30:53",
      "utterance": "せっかく　ご相談にいらっしゃったのですし少しでも　あなたの　お気持ちを理解したいので　もう少し　お話させてくださいね",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:31:13",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:32:58",
      "utterance": "友達から　嫌がらせされるのは　本当につらですね。先生にも聞き入れてもらえなくて…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:33:38",
      "utterance": "誰も分かってくれなくて嫌です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:33:57",
      "utterance": "この間、",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:34:04",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:34:24",
      "utterance": "体育の先生にも手紙書いたんです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:34:25",
      "utterance": "聴いてますよ",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:34:31",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:34:54",
      "utterance": "自分のこと知ってほしくて",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:35:09",
      "utterance": "わかってほしいよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:35:48",
      "utterance": "でも全然だめで、他の女子からも人気があるから難しいのかなと",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:36:24",
      "utterance": "女子校なんです。通っているのが。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:36:34",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:37:32",
      "utterance": "この高校に入って全然いいことがなくて",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:37:47",
      "utterance": "嫌になります",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:38:01",
      "utterance": "いいことないのは　お辛いですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:38:17",
      "utterance": "どうしたらいいかわからないです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:39:17",
      "utterance": "何をしても良いことがないのは　とても　すっきりしませんんものね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:39:24",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:39:47",
      "utterance": "どうしたらよいか　について　すこしおしえてくださいね",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:40:09",
      "utterance": "教えてください、というのは？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:40:15",
      "utterance": "よくわからないです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:41:55",
      "utterance": "嫌がらせが　いや周りの人への恐怖感なのか体育の先生への事など　もう少し聞かせてください",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:42:41",
      "utterance": "相談員さんが何が言いたいか分からないです。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:42:47",
      "utterance": "ごめんなさい　いや周りはいや　誤です",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:44:02",
      "utterance": "聞かせてください、はわかりますが、何をどう話したらいいか、よくわかりません。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:45:27",
      "utterance": "嫌がらせを　されるから　不安などが　おありなのかなと思ったのですが　いかがでしょう？",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:46:15",
      "utterance": "不安というか、、毎日うんざりしてます。いつ席替えがあるかもわからないし。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:46:47",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:47:45",
      "utterance": "父も母もあてにならないし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:48:44",
      "utterance": "誰もあてにならない　わかってくれないのは寂しいですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:48:51",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:51:20",
      "utterance": "でも　ここで私とお話されていますし少なくとも　私は　聞いてますし　わかってますから独りではないですよ。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:51:58",
      "utterance": "まあ、、",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:53:47",
      "utterance": "話をいつでも聞きますから　誰もわかってくれないと思うときまた　来てくださいね",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:54:06",
      "utterance": "もう終わりなんですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:54:40",
      "utterance": "すくなくとも　ここでは　ひとりでは　ありませんから。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:54:57",
      "utterance": "だからもう終わりなんですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:56:06",
      "utterance": "そろそろお時間はきましたが　今日は　どうでしたか？",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:56:31",
      "utterance": "これってAIなんですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T14:58:13",
      "utterance": "違いますよ",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T15:00:05",
      "utterance": "今日は限られたお時間の中で　お話を聞かせてもらいましたが　お話が　煮詰まらない感じでしたのでまた　いつでも来てほしいと　思いましたよ。",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T15:00:27",
      "utterance": "煮詰まらないって、私のせいですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T15:00:48",
      "utterance": "もういいです。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-09T15:01:11",
      "utterance": "さようなら",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-09T15:01:23",
      "utterance": "また来てくださいね　では終了しますね",
      "tag": "Other"
